        </p>
        <a class="read-more" href="calculator-en.html">Open the tool →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"/><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Race Time Predictor</h3>
        <p>
          Enter a recent result and see your estimated time for 5K, 10K, half marathon and
